No, that's fine, so long as it's not posted here claiming to be a true 
ascension (there are people here who can tell the difference). There's 
actually quite a lot of stuff you need to do to get a real flavour; you 
need the correct stats, intrinsics and luck as well as level and equipment. 
An alternative would be to keep a save game then rerun in explore mode if 
you fail (saving a game, running it in explore mode, *then* making the 
ascension run with the same game would be cheating however, as the help you 
gained from the practice would be too specific).

